    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS**\r\n\r\nDoran Estates are delighted to bring this well-presented three-bedroom house to the rental market in the mature and established Woodbank Avenue estate, close to Finglas Village.\r\n\r\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and briefly comprises an entrance hallway, bright living room with fireplace, separate dining room and a fully equipped kitchen with access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three good-sized bedrooms, all with built-in wardrobes, along with a family bathroom.\r\nThe property benefits from a southwest-facing rear garden, while the front provides off-street parking for two cars.\r\n\r\nThe location is a key feature of this property, with Finglas Village close by providing a range of local shops, services and amenities. There is also a selection of schools, parks and places of worship in the surrounding area. Charlestown Shopping Centre, including the Odeon cinema and IKEA, is within easy reach.\r\nDCU and Dublin Airport are also conveniently located, while the nearby M50 provides excellent access to Dublin City Centre and the wider road network.\r\nA well-located three-bedroom home offering generous living accommodation, a southwest-facing rear garden and excellent connectivity to the surrounding area."
      },
